flowchart LR
  T[Task Order] --> S[Workspace Snapshot]
  S --> W[Isolated Worker Worktree]
  W --> C[Candidate + Patch]
  C --> V[External Verification]
  V -- reject --> R[Rework]
  V -- accept --> O[Integration Order]
  O --> I[Controlled Integration Executor]
  I -- conflict --> CR[Conflict Report]
  I -- regression pass --> M[Local main commit]
  M --> IR[Integration Receipt]
  IR --> E[Engineer specs maintenance]
